                                        ],
                                        "note": "The tolerance is calculated from the scatter of the readings themselves, taken as the median absolute deviation of how far the collated copies put each symbol from where the copies read with it put it. expression: 366 readings, scattering by 1.36 mm at the start and 1.43 mm at the end about a median of -0.00 mm and 0.14 mm, with a threshold of 3.00 times the scatter. note: 462 readings, scattering by 0.69 mm at the start and 0.97 mm at the end about a median of -0.01 mm and -0.09 mm, with a threshold of 3.07 times the scatter. Each threshold is the point beyond which fewer than one reading of a sample of that size is expected to fall by chance, and the window is the threshold times the scatter about its median.",
