                                            "note": "Median over 527 held notes of the pitch each keeps from its first inner slot to its last, read to a fraction of a pixel from roll-image-parser's slots (punch-225/settings225.py); interquartile spread 0.0185 mm. The route gives 3.003 and 2.999 mm on St1 and St2, where the images give 3.001 and 2.999.",
